	(text "CAT6 UTP, 0.6-1 m"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fc734956-a5e3-491d-917d-627ebb393076")
	)
	(text "Stranded (patch) cable, through\nthe cable chain. Analog only.\n\nPad: wire = signal\n1: white-orange = E+ (3V3)\n8: orange = E- (GND)\n3: white-blue = S+ (SIG_P)\n4: blue = S- (SIG_N)\n5: white-green = TOOL_ID\n6: green = QRE_OUT\n2: white-brown = QRE 3V3\n7: brown = QRE GND\n\nAll DC: the QRE's LED on steady,\nno pulsing (kHz is in band for the ADC).\nHead end: J951 = pads 1, 3, 4, 8;\nJ954 = pads 2, 5, 6, 7."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "89bc51b1-2432-4e1a-bca6-50d0ddf997c5")
	)
	(text "CAT6 #2: TOOL 5 V + USB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dfd79e30-daee-4c10-b381-1c85368cc54b")
	)
	(text "Pad: wire = signal\n1-3: white-orange, -green, -brown\n     = +5V_TOOL\n6-8: orange, green, brown = GND\n4: white-blue = USB D+\n5: blue = USB D-\n\nThree wires each way: MX1.25\ncontacts ~1 A each, 2 A fuse.\n~0.03 R a way per metre."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a1da063b-eee8-4d80-8ba1-fd5145aea684")
	)
